HST Office: .uno:HstTabsDialog opens Paragraph on its Tabs page, and that page offers Word's default tab stops
when Writer's Paragraph dialog shows it. .uno:ParagraphDialog gains the Page argument that SID_PARA_DLG already reads.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-writer.py tabs
